[{"id":"MTk2-q01","number":1,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Dalam suasana basa, logam kobalt (Co) dapat mengalami reaksi oksidasi menjadi <img alt=\"{Co(OH)}_{3}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%7BCo%28OH%29%7D_%7B3%7D\" /> sementara natrium hipoklorit, NaOCl, dapat direduksi menjadi NaCl. Apabila reaksi tersebut disetarakan maka koefisien reaksi kobalt dan NaOCl masing-masing adalah ....<br />","choices":["2 dan 3","1 dan 3","3 dan 2","1 dan 2","3 dan 1"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/ODIzOQ"},{"id":"MTk2-q02","number":2,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Massa <img alt=\"{CaCI}_{2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%7BCaCI%7D_%7B2%7D\" /> yang dibutuhkan untuk membuat 500 mL larutan <img alt=\"{CaCI}_{2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%7BCaCI%7D_%7B2%7D\" /> yang konsentrasinya 0,200 M adalah ....<br />","choices":["0,100 g","0,200 g","5,55 g","11,1 g","22,2 g"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/ODI0MA"},{"id":"MTk2-q03","number":3,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Di antara kelompok senyawa berikut ini, yang merupakan senyawa ionik adalah ....<br />","choices":["&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\mathrm{N}_{2} \\mathrm{O}_{4}, \\mathrm{NH}_{3}, \\mathrm{NH}_{4} \\mathrm{Cl}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cmathrm%7BN%7D_%7B2%7D%20%5Cmathrm%7BO%7D_%7B4%7D%2C%20%5Cmathrm%7BNH%7D_%7B3%7D%2C%20%5Cmathrm%7BNH%7D_%7B4%7D%20%5Cmathrm%7BCl%7D\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\mathrm{NH}_{4} \\mathrm{Cl}, \\mathrm{NaCl}, \\mathrm{Na}_{2} \\mathrm{O}_{2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cmathrm%7BNH%7D_%7B4%7D%20%5Cmathrm%7BCl%7D%2C%20%5Cmathrm%7BNaCl%7D%2C%20%5Cmathrm%7BNa%7D_%7B2%7D%20%5Cmathrm%7BO%7D_%7B2%7D\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\mathrm{NF}_{3},\\left(\\mathrm{NH}_{4}\\right)_{2} \\mathrm{SO}_{4}, \\mathrm{PCl}_{3}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cmathrm%7BNF%7D_%7B3%7D%2C%5Cleft%28%5Cmathrm%7BNH%7D_%7B4%7D%5Cright%29_%7B2%7D%20%5Cmathrm%7BSO%7D_%7B4%7D%2C%20%5Cmathrm%7BPCl%7D_%7B3%7D\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\mathrm{AsH}_{3}, \\mathrm{AlCl}_{3}, \\mathrm{PCl}_{3}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cmathrm%7BAsH%7D_%7B3%7D%2C%20%5Cmathrm%7BAlCl%7D_%7B3%7D%2C%20%5Cmathrm%7BPCl%7D_%7B3%7D\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\mathrm{NCl}_{3}, \\mathrm{NaCl}, \\mathrm{CaC}_{2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cmathrm%7BNCl%7D_%7B3%7D%2C%20%5Cmathrm%7BNaCl%7D%2C%20%5Cmathrm%7BCaC%7D_%7B2%7D\" />"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/ODI0MQ"},{"id":"MTk2-q04","number":4,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Asam sulfat, <img alt=\"{H}_{2}{SO}_{4}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%7BH%7D_%7B2%7D%7BSO%7D_%7B4%7D\" /> , dibuat dengan mereaksikan 400 g <img alt=\"\\text {SO}_{2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctext%20%7BSO%7D_%7B2%7D\" /> , 175 g <img alt=\"\\text {O}_{2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctext%20%7BO%7D_%7B2%7D\" /> dan 125 g <img alt=\"\\text {H}_{2}\\text {O}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctext%20%7BH%7D_%7B2%7D%5Ctext%20%7BO%7D\" />. Reaksi berlangsung menurut persamaan reaksi (belum setara)<br /><br /><img alt=\"\\mathrm{SO}_{2}(\\mathrm{g})+\\mathrm{O}_{2}(\\mathrm{g})+\\mathrm{H}_{2} \\mathrm{O} \\rightarrow \\mathrm{H}_{2} \\mathrm{SO}_{4}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cmathrm%7BSO%7D_%7B2%7D%28%5Cmathrm%7Bg%7D%29&amp;plus;%5Cmathrm%7BO%7D_%7B2%7D%28%5Cmathrm%7Bg%7D%29&amp;plus;%5Cmathrm%7BH%7D_%7B2%7D%20%5Cmathrm%7BO%7D%20%5Crightarrow%20%5Cmathrm%7BH%7D_%7B2%7D%20%5Cmathrm%7BSO%7D_%7B4%7D\" /><br /> Pernyataan yang tidak benar adalah ....<br />","choices":["Jika reaksi berlangsung sempurna, maka 6,25 mol <img alt=\"\\text {SO}_{2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctext%20%7BSO%7D_%7B2%7D\" /> berubah menjadi 612,5 g <img alt=\"{H}_{2}{SO}_{4}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%7BH%7D_%7B2%7D%7BSO%7D_%7B4%7D\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\text {SO}_{2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctext%20%7BSO%7D_%7B2%7D\" />&nbsp;merupakan pereaksi pembatas","Air terdapat dalam jumlah berlebih","Pada proses ini dihasilkan 700 g <img alt=\"{H}_{2}{SO}_{4}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%7BH%7D_%7B2%7D%7BSO%7D_%7B4%7D\" />","Pada akhir reaksi terdapat sisa oksigen 75 g"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/ODI0Mg"},{"id":"MTk2-q05","number":5,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Bila nilai <img alt=\"\\Delta H^{\\circ}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5CDelta%20H%5E%7B%5Ccirc%7D\" /> untuk reaksi: Mg(s) + <img alt=\"\\text{CL}_{2}(g)\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctext%7BCL%7D_%7B2%7D%28g%29\" />&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\rightarrow \\text{2MgCI}_{2}(s)\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Crightarrow%20%5Ctext%7B2MgCI%7D_%7B2%7D%28s%29\" /> adalah &ndash;1283,6 kJ, maka entalpi pembentukan standar, <img alt=\"\\Delta H^{\\circ}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5CDelta%20H%5E%7B%5Ccirc%7D\" /> , magnesium klorida adalah ....<br />","choices":["0 kJ/mol","&ndash;321 kJ/mol","&ndash; 641,8 kJ/mol","1283,6 kJ/mol","&ndash;1283,6 kJ/mol"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/ODI0Mw"},{"id":"MTk2-q06","number":6,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Berdasarkan data kalor pembentukan <img alt=\"\\text {H}_{2}\\text {O}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctext%20%7BH%7D_%7B2%7D%5Ctext%20%7BO%7D\" />(g) = &ndash;241,8 kJ/mol, kalor disosiasi <img alt=\"\\text{H}_{2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctext%7BH%7D_%7B2%7D\" /> (g) = +436 kJ/mol, dan kalor disosiasi <img alt=\"\\text {O}_{2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctext%20%7BO%7D_%7B2%7D\" /> (g) = +498 kJ/mol, maka energi ikatan O&ndash;H adalah ....<br />","choices":["221,6 kJ/mol","443,2 kJ/mol","463,4 kJ/mol","587,9 kJ/mol","926,8 kJ/mol"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/ODI0NA"},{"id":"MTk2-q07","number":7,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Di antara serial bilangan kuantum berikut, yang menjelaskan orbital 4f adalah ....<br />","choices":["n = 2, l = 0, ml = 0","n = 3, l = 1, ml = -1","n = 3, l = 2, ml = -1","n = 4, l = 2, ml = +1","n = 4, l = 3, ml = +2"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/ODI0NQ"},{"id":"MTk2-q08","number":8,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Di antara unsur berikut, yang dapat membentuk ion bermuatan +2 dengan konfigurasi elektron <img alt=\"\\text {1s}^{2}\\text {2s}^{2}\\text {2p}^{6}\\text {3s}^{2}\\text {3p}^{6}\\text {3d}^{10}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctext%20%7B1s%7D%5E%7B2%7D%5Ctext%20%7B2s%7D%5E%7B2%7D%5Ctext%20%7B2p%7D%5E%7B6%7D%5Ctext%20%7B3s%7D%5E%7B2%7D%5Ctext%20%7B3p%7D%5E%7B6%7D%5Ctext%20%7B3d%7D%5E%7B10%7D\" /> adalah ....<br />","choices":["K","Si","Zn","Ca","Ge"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/ODI0Ng"},{"id":"MTk2-q09","number":9,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Di antara molekul atau ion berikut ini: <img alt=\"\\text {SO}_{3}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctext%20%7BSO%7D_%7B3%7D\" />, <img alt=\"\\text {CO}_{2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctext%20%7BCO%7D_%7B2%7D\" />, <img alt=\"\\text {NO}{_{2}}^{+}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctext%20%7BNO%7D%7B_%7B2%7D%7D%5E%7B&amp;plus;%7D\" />&nbsp;, dan <img alt=\"\\text{CIO}{_{2}}^{-}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctext%7BCIO%7D%7B_%7B2%7D%7D%5E%7B-%7D\" /> &nbsp;, yang isoleketronik adalah ....<br />","choices":["<img alt=\"\\text {SO}_{3}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctext%20%7BSO%7D_%7B3%7D\" /> dan <img alt=\"\\text {CO}_{2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctext%20%7BCO%7D_%7B2%7D\" />","<img alt=\"\\text {NO}{_{2}}^{+}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctext%20%7BNO%7D%7B_%7B2%7D%7D%5E%7B&amp;plus;%7D\" /> dan <img alt=\"\\text{CIO}{_{2}}^{-}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctext%7BCIO%7D%7B_%7B2%7D%7D%5E%7B-%7D\" />","<img alt=\"\\text {CO}_{2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctext%20%7BCO%7D_%7B2%7D\" /> dan <img alt=\"\\text {NO}{_{2}}^{+}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctext%20%7BNO%7D%7B_%7B2%7D%7D%5E%7B&amp;plus;%7D\" />","<img alt=\"\\text {NO}{_{2}}^{+}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctext%20%7BNO%7D%7B_%7B2%7D%7D%5E%7B&amp;plus;%7D\" /> dan <img alt=\"\\text {SO}_{3}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctext%20%7BSO%7D_%7B3%7D\" />","<img alt=\"\\text {CO}_{2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctext%20%7BCO%7D_%7B2%7D\" /> dan <img alt=\"\\text{CIO}{_{2}}^{-}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctext%7BCIO%7D%7B_%7B2%7D%7D%5E%7B-%7D\" />"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/ODI0Nw"},{"id":"MTk2-q10","number":10,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Berdasarakan geometri molekulnya, di antara ion atau molekul berikut yang mempunyai momen dipol paling besar adalah ....<br />","choices":["<img alt=\"\\text {NO}{_{3}}^{-}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctext%20%7BNO%7D%7B_%7B3%7D%7D%5E%7B-%7D\" />","<img alt=\"\\text{SO}{_{2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctext%7BSO%7D%7B_%7B2%7D\" />","<img alt=\"\\text {SiH}{_{4}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctext%20%7BSiH%7D%7B_%7B4%7D\" />","<img alt=\"\\text {BF}{_{4}}^{-}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctext%20%7BBF%7D%7B_%7B4%7D%7D%5E%7B-%7D\" />","<img alt=\"\\text{PCI}_{5}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctext%7BPCI%7D_%7B5%7D\" />"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/ODI0OA"},{"id":"MTk2-q11","number":11,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Urutan yang benar mengenai peningkatan ukuran radius ion <img alt=\"Na^{+}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?Na%5E%7B&amp;plus;%7D\" /> , <img alt=\"MG^{2+}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?MG%5E%7B2&amp;plus;%7D\" />, dan <img alt=\"AI^{3+}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?AI%5E%7B3&amp;plus;%7D\" /> adalah ....<br />","choices":["&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\mathrm{Na}^{+}&lt;\\mathrm{Mg}^{2+}&lt;\\mathrm{Al}^{3+}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cmathrm%7BNa%7D%5E%7B&amp;plus;%7D%3C%5Cmathrm%7BMg%7D%5E%7B2&amp;plus;%7D%3C%5Cmathrm%7BAl%7D%5E%7B3&amp;plus;%7D\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\mathrm{Mg}^{2+}&lt;\\mathrm{Al}^{3+}&lt;\\mathrm{Na}^{+}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cmathrm%7BMg%7D%5E%7B2&amp;plus;%7D%3C%5Cmathrm%7BAl%7D%5E%7B3&amp;plus;%7D%3C%5Cmathrm%7BNa%7D%5E%7B&amp;plus;%7D\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"Al^{3+}&lt;N a^{+}&lt;M g^{2+}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?Al%5E%7B3&amp;plus;%7D%3CN%20a%5E%7B&amp;plus;%7D%3CM%20g%5E%7B2&amp;plus;%7D\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"Al^{3+}&lt;M g^{2+}&lt;N a^{+}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?Al%5E%7B3&amp;plus;%7D%3CM%20g%5E%7B2&amp;plus;%7D%3CN%20a%5E%7B&amp;plus;%7D\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\mathrm{Na}^{+}&lt;\\mathrm{A}\\mathrm{l}^{3+}&lt;\\mathrm{Mg}^{2+}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cmathrm%7BNa%7D%5E%7B&amp;plus;%7D%3C%5Cmathrm%7BA%7D%5Cmathrm%7Bl%7D%5E%7B3&amp;plus;%7D%3C%5Cmathrm%7BMg%7D%5E%7B2&amp;plus;%7D\" />"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/ODI0OQ"},{"id":"MTk2-q12","number":12,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Di antara senyawa ion berikut, yang mempunyai energi kisi paling kecil adalah ...<br />","choices":["NaI","LiF","KBr","NaCl","CsI"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/ODI1MA"},{"id":"MTk2-q13","number":13,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Jenis orbital hibrid atom C yang diberi tanda pada senyawa berikut ini adalah ....<br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200606071957.jpg\" style=\"height:318px; width:423px\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/ODI1MQ"},{"id":"MTk2-q14","number":14,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Pada 298 K, perubahan entalpi pembentukan standar dan perubahan entropi standar dari reaksi berikut : C(s) + &frac12;O2(g) + 2H2(g) ⇌ CH3OH(g) berturut-turut adalah &ndash;205 kJ/mol dan 240 J/mol.K. Maka nilai ln Kp untuk reaksi tersebut adalah ....<br />","choices":["28,9","53,9","111,6","133,5","2931,6"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/ODI1Mg"},{"id":"MTk2-q15","number":15,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Perhatikanlah grafik energi reaksi hipotetis berikut : A + B <img alt=\"\\rightarrow\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Crightarrow\" /> C + D,<br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200606072131.jpg\" style=\"height:199px; width:316px\" /><br /> Nilai energi yang mengalami perubahan bila ditambahkan katalis adalah ....<br />","choices":["Hanya I","Hanya II","I dan II","I dan III","I, II, dan III"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/ODI1Mw"},{"id":"MTk2-q16","number":16,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Perhatikan reaksi kesetimbangan hipotetis berikut ini:<br /><br /> A(g) + 2B (g) ⇌ 3C (g) + D(g)<br /><br /> Sebanyak 5 mol A dan 3 mol B ditempatkan dalam suatu wadah dan kemudian didiamkan. Setelah terjadi kesetimbangan, ternyata terdapat 1 mol B. Jumlah mol A, C dan D pada kesetimbangan adalah ....<br />","choices":["1,0 mol A, 3,0 mol C, 1,0 mol D","4,0 mol A, 3,0 mol C, 1,0 mol D","1,0 mol A, 6,0 mol C, 1,0 mol D","3,0 mol A, 2,0 mol C, 2,0 mol D","4,0 mol A, 3,0 mol C, 4,0 mol D"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/ODI1NA"},{"id":"MTk2-q17","number":17,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Senyawa aktif dalam aspirin adalah asam asetilsalisilat, <img alt=\"\\text {HC}_{9}\\text {H}_{7}\\text {O}_{4}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctext%20%7BHC%7D_%7B9%7D%5Ctext%20%7BH%7D_%7B7%7D%5Ctext%20%7BO%7D_%7B4%7D\" />, yang mempunyai nilai tetapan kesetimbangan asam, <img alt=\"\\text {K}_{a}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctext%20%7BK%7D_%7Ba%7D\" />&nbsp;<img alt=\"3,3 \\times 10^{-4}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?3%2C3%20%5Ctimes%2010%5E%7B-4%7D\" /> . Agar larutan mempunyai pH 3,0, maka perbandingan konsentrasi ion asetilsalisilat terhadap asam asetilsalisilat dalam larutan haruslah sama dengan ....<br />","choices":["0,03","0,13","0,23","0,33","0,43"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/ODI1NQ"},{"id":"MTk2-q18","number":18,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Larutan <img alt=\"\\text {Fe(NO}_{3})_{3}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctext%20%7BFe%28NO%7D_%7B3%7D%29_%7B3%7D\" /> dielektrolisis dengan elektroda platina hingga diperoleh endapan besi seberat 24,2 g. Pada elektrolisis ini, volume gas yang dihasilkan pada suhu <img alt=\"0 ^{\\circ}C\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?0%20%5E%7B%5Ccirc%7DC\" /> dan tekanan 1 atmosfer adalah ....<br />","choices":["1,68 L","2,24 L","3,36 L","4,48 L","7,26 L"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/ODI1Ng"},{"id":"MTk2-q19","number":19,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Hasil kali kelarutan <img alt=\"\\text {MgF}_{2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctext%20%7BMgF%7D_%7B2%7D\" /> dalam air murni adalah <img alt=\"7,4 \\times 10^{-11}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?7%2C4%20%5Ctimes%2010%5E%7B-11%7D\" />. Hasil kali kelarutan <img alt=\"\\text {MgF}_{2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctext%20%7BMgF%7D_%7B2%7D\" /> dalam larutan NaF 0,1 M adalah ....</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200606083713.jpg\" style=\"height:100px; width:118px\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/ODI1Nw"},{"id":"MTk2-q20","number":20,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Elektrolisis umum digunakan untuk mendapatkan logam murni dari ion-ionnya. Suatu percobaan dilakukan dengan memberikan arus sebesar 3 A selama 2 jam terhadap larutan ion logam X yang memiliki muatan +2. Di akhir percobaan, diperoleh logam X sebanyak 7,11 g. Logam X tersebut adalah<br />","choices":["Ba","Ni","Sr","Cu","Zn"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/ODI1OA"},{"id":"MTk2-q21","number":21,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Kelarutan molar magnesium hidroksida <img alt=\"(K_{sp}= 8\\times 10^{-12})\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%28K_%7Bsp%7D%3D%208%5Ctimes%2010%5E%7B-12%7D%29\" /> dalam suatu larutan penyangga dengan pH = 11 adalah ...<br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200606083848.jpg\" style=\"height:103px; width:116px\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/ODI1OQ"},{"id":"MTk2-q22","number":22,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Tatanama yang paling tepat untuk senyawa organik berikut adalah<br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200606084323.jpg\" style=\"height:101px; width:178px\" /><br />","choices":["(E)-1-sikloheksilbut-2-en-1-ol","(Z)-1-sikloheksilbut-2-en-1-ol","(E)-4-sikloheksil-4-ol-but-2-ena","(Z)-4-sikloheksil-4-ol-but-2-ena","((Z)-1-ol-but-2-enil)sikloheksana"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/ODI2MA"},{"id":"MTk2-q23","number":23,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Urutan keasaman senyawa turunan asam asetat berikut mulai dari yang paling asam adalah ...<br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200606084843.jpg\" style=\"height:102px; width:258px\" />","choices":["I &gt; II &gt; III","I &gt; III &gt; II","II &gt; III &gt; I","II &gt; I &gt; III","III &gt; II &gt; I"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/ODI2MQ"},{"id":"MTk2-q24","number":24,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Di antara oksidator di bawah ini yang paling sesuai digunakan untuk mengoksidasi senyawa propena menjadi 1,2-propanadiol, adalah ....<br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200606190656.jpg\" style=\"height:27px; width:455px\" /><br />","choices":["I, dan II","I dan IV","Hanya III","III dan IV","Hanya II"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/ODI2Mg"},{"id":"MTk2-q25","number":25,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Pernyataan yang tidak benar mengenai senyawa berikut adalah ....<br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200606190847.jpg\" style=\"height:132px; width:231px\" />","choices":["Mempunyai delapan ikatan &sigma;-antar atom karbon dan empat ikatan rangkap dua yang terkonjugasi.","Nama senyawa tersebut adalah 4-vinil-1,3,5-heptatriena.","Dapat mengikat delapan atom klor jika direaksikan dengan <img alt=\"\\text{Cl}_{2}/\\text{CCl}_{4}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctext%7BCl%7D_%7B2%7D/%5Ctext%7BCCl%7D_%7B4%7D\" /> berlebih.","Mempunyai empat ikatan &pi; (pi) dengan nama 4-propenil-1,3,5- heksatriena","Mempunyai delapan ikatan &sigma;-antar atom karbon, dapat mengalami reaksi adisi elektrofilik jika direaksikan dengan larutan HBr dalam air."],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/ODI2Mw"},{"id":"MTk2-q26","number":26,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Toluena dapat mengalami reaksi substitusi elektrofilik. Di antara kelima pereaksi di bawah ini yang akan menghasilkan produk pada posisi orto dan para toluena adalah ....<br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200606191115.jpg\" style=\"height:88px; width:148px\" /><br /> &nbsp;</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/ODI2NA"},{"id":"MTk2-q27","number":27,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Di antara pereaksi di bawah ini yang dapat digunakan untuk membedakan antara fenol dan asam benzoat adalah ....<br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200606191153.jpg\" style=\"height:86px; width:132px\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/ODI2NQ"},{"id":"MTk2-q28","number":28,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Pereaksi I dan II yang paling tepat digunakan pada tahapan reaksi di bawah ini<br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200606191244.jpg\" style=\"height:65px; width:345px\" /><br /> Adalah ....<br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200606191329.jpg\" style=\"height:127px; width:226px\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/ODI2Ng"},{"id":"MTk2-q29","number":29,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Senyawa trikloretena banyak dipakai sebagai bahan pembersih, di antara pereaksi berikut yang ketika bereaksi dengan trikloretena dapat menghasilkan senyawa yang mempunyai satu atom karbon yang asimetris adalah ...<br />","choices":["<img alt=\"\\text {Br}_{2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctext%20%7BBr%7D_%7B2%7D\" />","<img alt=\"\\text{H}_{2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctext%7BH%7D_%7B2%7D\" />","HCl","NaOH.","NaCN"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/ODI2Nw"},{"id":"MTk2-q30","number":30,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Di antara pereaksi berikut yang paling tepat untuk mensintesis etana dari etil alkohol seperti pada tahapan reaksi berikut<br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200606191451.jpg\" style=\"height:59px; width:396px\" /><br /> adalah ....<br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200606191529.jpg\" style=\"height:102px; width:309px\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/ODI2OA"}]
